<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/february-22">22 February</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">George Washington is born in Virginia</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Born at Popes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/muscogee">Creek</a> in Westmoreland County, Washington commanded the Continental Army in the Revolutionary War and became the first President of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/virginia">Virginia</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/december-7">7 December</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">The Theatre Royal, Covent Garden, opens</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">John Rich opened his new <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/theatre">theatre</a> at Covent Garden with Congreve's The Way of the World. Twice rebuilt after fires, it became the Royal Opera House in 1892.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/theatre">Theatre</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-resht" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/treaty-of-resht.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Treaty</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-resht">Treaty of Resht</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Treaty of Resht was an agreement of 1732 between Russia and Iran, by which Russia agreed to return parts of the Caspian provinces it had occupied after the collapse of Safavid power.</p></div></li></ol></section>
